{"about_the_game":"A relaxing and wholesome &quot;clear-up&quot; cooking game. Match 3 objects to cook them in the pan. Don't let the pan get too full. Clear all the objects, clear your mind.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Clear_your_mind_1.gif?t=1726497088\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Match 3 objects to cook them in the pan<br></li><li>Don't let the pan get too full<br></li><li>Clear all the objects to pass the level<br></li><li>Perfect game for those that get satisfaction from clearing up clutter or hearing the sound of food sizzling. </li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Relaxing_sounds_and_effects_2.gif?t=1726497088\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Relaxing sounds that help you relax<br></li><li> If you like the sound of food sizzling, this game is perfect for you.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Lots_of_levels.gif?t=1726497088\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Lots of unique level variations<br></li><li> Randomly generated levels for unlimited relaxation.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Phsyics_items_1.gif?t=1726497088\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 200+ unique items<br></li><li> Physics-based items</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Controls.gif?t=1726497088\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Just tap on an item<br></li><li> Simple satisfying gameplay</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Relaxing music and effects.<br></li><li> No timers, play at your own pace.<br></li><li> Over 200+ physics items.<br></li><li> Lots of unique level variations.<br></li><li> Quick levels. Levels range from 30 seconds up to 5 minutes.<br></li><li> Intuitive controls, just tap the item.<br></li><li> Helps you relax and de-stress.<br></li><li> Easy to pick up and play. Fun for all ages.<br></li><li> Various gameplay, graphics, and performance settings.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2809110?t=1726497088","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2809110?t=1726497088","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726497088","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726497088","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"A relaxing and wholesome &quot;clear-up&quot; cooking game. Match 3 objects to cook them in the pan. Don't let the pan get too full. Clear all the objects, clear your mind.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Clear_your_mind_1.gif?t=1726497088\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Match 3 objects to cook them in the pan<br></li><li>Don't let the pan get too full<br></li><li>Clear all the objects to pass the level<br></li><li>Perfect game for those that get satisfaction from clearing up clutter or hearing the sound of food sizzling. </li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Relaxing_sounds_and_effects_2.gif?t=1726497088\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Relaxing sounds that help you relax<br></li><li> If you like the sound of food sizzling, this game is perfect for you.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2809110/extras/Lots_of_levels.gif?t=1726